{
 "id": 1832475,
 "titulo": "3/18 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1742281292000,
 "modificada": 1760648065527,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1832475",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281071476\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d8840863d7cb40b18d86c82b253435c6_1742281071476_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The darkness is gradually spreading throughout the city<br>\nand those who are fighting against it have come together<br>\nforeshadowing that a major event will occur.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Meet the March Update we have prepared in celebration of&nbsp;<br>\nthe addition of the Marvel Television’s <em>Daredevil: Born Again</em> theme.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span> has been added to <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Daredevil</span>, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Kingpin</span>, and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Punisher</span><br>\nwho are fighting over the future of the city, and a <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">new Uniform</span> has been added to all<br>\nincluding another Super Hero, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">White Tiger</span>, serving as a vigilante.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Also, the Team-Up Collection: Defenders&nbsp;<br>\nhas been added for the upgrade of the Defenders.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Other improvements to make the game more enjoyable have been added as well,&nbsp;<br>\nso please check the details below!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Four New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Four new Uniforms have been added to celebrate&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">the Marvel Television’s <em>Daredevil: Born Again</em> inspired Update.<br>\nCheck out the abilities of Daredevil &lt;<em>Marvel Television’s Daredevil: Born Again</em>&gt;,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Kingpin &lt;<em>Marvel Television’s Daredevil: Born Again</em>&gt;, Punisher &lt;<em>Marvel Television’s Daredevil: Born Again</em>&gt;, and White Tiger &lt;<em>Marvel Television’s Daredevil: Born Again</em>&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects of the Uniform are based on the maximum skill level stats.<br>\n* The four new Uniforms will be on sale for </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">40% off during the &lt;March Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1632\" id=\"1742281086376\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/37b6a96021a545dd9048c20b856059db_1742281086376_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1527\" id=\"1742281097766\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2bd1dbf226a148a199c67c86e7606fdc_1742281097766_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1617\" id=\"1742281109101\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/34558677808b48a3b05504f979a0bc48_1742281109101_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1385\" id=\"1742281119595\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/da16de794ce54bfe9365a05f0146ea03_1742281119595_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Daredevil, Kingpin, and Punisher Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-4 Advancement has been added to each hero.<br>\nThe heroes will strive for their desires in the city of chaos.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"861\" id=\"1742281132504\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d4a13300655d41c7b8f7c1b742e72ddc_1742281132504_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ White Tiger and Misty Knight Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">White Tiger and Misty Knight will acquire&nbsp;<br>\nPotential Awakening &amp; Transcendence through the March Update!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"960\" id=\"1742281143347\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/3a5ac08ce74848c894cb9eb4076002a0_1742281143347_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281047435\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/8147d566d6a94642af909a4f4a814a15_1742281047435.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281053294\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/1f26ebe167f141fd8fa8be8dd48f2bb2_1742281053294.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Team-Up Collection: Defenders</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A Team-Up collection that can upgrade Defenders heroes has been added.<br>\nComplete missions to acquire skills that will help your battle.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1742281156309\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/521276562ae14879b03c08eb5928c598_1742281156309_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"338\" id=\"1742281167257\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8ab3c2a070284315a72f7efad49dc7b4_1742281167257_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* When the same hero is set under multiple Team-Up Collection themes, the following applies:</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Collection Option: Only the theme option with the highest collection option level will be applied<br>\n- Team-Up Option: All Team-Up options apply</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Artifacts</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Daredevil, White Tiger, and Misty Knight will be added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">﻿* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"714\" id=\"1742281178753\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0da2217236f6407eab60fe049db16d68_1742281178753_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Future Pass Plus Season &amp; Special Icons</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new season of Future Pass Plus will begin after the update.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Future Pass Plus Rewards]</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"735\" id=\"1742281192370\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/16891e3cb5b1443fb9c9c63a07528d35_1742281192370_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- The Future Pass Plus effects will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Future Pass Plus - Legendary / Mythic that has been unlocked&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">will only be applied during the season the Pass was purchased.&nbsp;<br>\nThe Pass rewards will only be available during the same season.<br>\n- The Future Pass Plus - Mythic can be purchased after purchasing the Future Pass Plus - Legendary.<br>\n- Future Pass Plus - Legendary / Mythic will not be available for purchase when the season is about to end.&nbsp;<br>\nPlease check the sale schedule in the game.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">​</span></span></span><span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Special Icons that will represent Agents have been added.<br>\nCollect two new Icons as Future Pass Plus rewards,&nbsp;<br>\none as an Otherworld Battle reward, and one more from the upcoming Event!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[March Update New Special Icon]</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281209848\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/987dad88cdac4e8586f738ffb682c312_1742281209848.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281209862\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/46f7676c3d1c4e8f9c24ffd38fce8680_1742281209862.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"> <img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281209877\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/dc9aedf3cd7746bb803417f962521d72_1742281209877.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281209894\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/53dd4f03aa20445f8570a919ed3ad0de_1742281209894.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Uniform Collection</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new Uniforms inspired by Marvel Television’s Daredevil: Born Again theme.<br>\nComplete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn a reward.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1742281234479\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9185f1b3d4dc4534ac833adb20abb23f_1742281234479_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Update Hot Deals &amp; New Products</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Update Hot Deal products have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Event Schedule:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 3/19 Maintenance - 4/15 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),<br>\nAfter the 3/19 Maintenance - 4/15 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- The products below are available under the Update Hot Deals category in the Store.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please check the details in-game after the update.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"255\" id=\"1742281245593\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c211759b4976403d915328852d0b95c9_1742281245593_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* 7 types of tokens from the Midnight Suns to the Defenders theme<br>\ncan be acquired from the Selector: Collection Token.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ 8 Web Shop exclusive products will be added.<br>\nPlease visit the Web Shop after the update for more information.<br>\n<a href=\"https://mffshop.netmarble.com/en\" target=\"_self\">[Go to the MARVEL Future Fight Web Shop]</a></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Other Improvements and Changes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The Giant Boss Raid features have been improved as the following.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ The Set Dealer feature has been added to the Save Giant Boss Raid Team and Select Characters screen.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Agents will start the battle with the hero set as the dealer.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1742281256432\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fbc67e67058248849bdf835f74ff8c6e_1742281256432_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ A feature to leave the battle has been added to the menu available during battle.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1742346482706\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e949b06eb6164774b3acd5cd904a7ee3_1742346482706_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. A menu where events are categorized has been added on the right side of the main screen.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The events will be categorized into battles, missions, others, and shops.<br>\n- The Conquest - Battle stage banner will be added to the battles category.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1742281277823\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ac971a0f712646d8989f2af8973c3486_1742281277823_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The World Event schedule has been changed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"227\" id=\"1742281380646\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/61b07c2a9d034ffea067086e718ac68a_1742281380646_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The difficulty of some Daily/Weekly missions in Otherworld Battle has been adjusted.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"361\" id=\"1742281390926\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/38dae8ca9b86408e95edcda72ec95e4e_1742281390926_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. Collection Token: Symbiote will be added&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">to the Small / Medium Collection Token Chests that can be acquired from Alliance Battle.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Some heroes stopping after transforming during battle in Otherworld Battle has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Some texts not displaying&nbsp;in the 5th Active Skill&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">of Misty Knight &lt;All-New, All-Different&gt; have been fixed.</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Missing Texts: Applies to: Enemies, Decreases All Speeds by -N%.(N Sec.)<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Only the text has been wrongly displayed, and the effects have been applied normally.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The stun motion not applying to Mysterio &lt;Summer Mystery&gt; has been fixed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Only the motion has been wrongly displayed, and the effects have been applied normally.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The cooldown time of the 2nd active skill resetting when using the 1st active skill&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">after meeting certain conditions with Luna Snow &lt;Lifestyle Series 1&gt; has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. The remove all debuff effect of Deadpool &lt;Marvel Studios’ Deadpool &amp; Wolverine&gt;’s&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">leader skill applying to all team members instead of self has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. Some patterns of World Boss Legend+ &lt;Corvus &amp; Proxima&gt;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">targeting summoned creatures instead of the hero being controlled have been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">7. The energy attack increase rate of Leader &lt;Modern&gt;’s team effect&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">“New Intelligencia” being misapplied has been fixed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\">Before: +5.04% -&gt; After: +5.35%</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1742281410776\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ddcb6f5261ff4e6f8f02f34df5489439_1742281410776_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
